==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|sla-pro|ru}} {{recons|govoriti|lang=sla-pro}}, from {{proto|ine-pro|gow(H)-|to call, cry|lang=ru}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Ru-говорить.ogg|audio}}
* {{IPA|[ɡəvʌˈrʲitʲ]|lang=ru}}

===Verb===
'''говорить''' (govorít’) {{impf}}, [[сказать]] (skazát’) {{pf.}}

# to [[speak]], to [[talk]]
# to [[say]], to [[tell]]

